  "description": "One synapse serves every configured bot (cfg.Bots = aerial, miorine, suletta). handlePullRequestRegistryAction used to re-filter with the single-bot isForeignBotPR(meta, cfg.BotID), so every sibling-owned PR's synchronize, closed and auto_merge_disabled were dropped by legacy and shadow alike: no UpdatePRSync, no HandleSynchronized, no fact (aerial#2308, g3-shadow-soak-r7). It now uses the multi-bot isForeignBotEvent like processPullRequest and the restate-owned path. A registered miorine PR synchronized to a new head: legacy writes the new head to the row, publishes one synchronize fact and sends one legacy-owned HandleSynchronized carrying the stored owner; PRObject lands on the same head, keeps owner miorine and the projection agrees with the row. A bot outside cfg.Bots (gundam) stays dropped: no row write, no fact, no send, PRObject keeps the registered head.",
